
---

# 3. `.env.example`

Create this file in your repo:

```env
# =========================================
# CognoDB Graph Benchmark Environment File
# =========================================
# Copy this file to .env and fill in values.
# NEVER commit your real .env file.
# =========================================

# CognoDB Cloud
COGNODB_URI=
COGNODB_PASS=

# Neo4j Aura Free
AURA_URI=
AURA_USER=neo4j
AURA_PASS=

# Neo4j Sandbox
SANDBOX_URI=
SANDBOX_USER=neo4j
SANDBOX_PASS=

# Memgraph Cloud
MEMGRAPH_URI=
MEMGRAPH_USER=
MEMGRAPH_PASS=

# Local Docker Neo4j
DOCKER_URI=bolt://localhost:7687
DOCKER_USER=neo4j
DOCKER_PASS=benchmark123